{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16996","headline":"归燕 · 武元衡","name":"归燕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春色遍芳菲，闲檐双燕归。\n还同旧侣至，来遶故巢飞。\n敢望烟霄达，多慙羽翮微。\n衔泥傍金砌，拾蘂到荆扉。\n云海经时别，雕梁长日依。\n主人能一顾，转盻自光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}